# Wrangler static-assets upload excludes for the alloflow-cdn Workers deploy.
# (Cloudflare build runs `npx wrangler deploy` with assets directory "." = repo root;
# wrangler reads this file from the assets root, .gitignore syntax.)
#
# WHY: Workers assets have a hard 25 MiB/file limit. desktop/web-app/public/
# video_studio/vendor/ffmpeg/core/ffmpeg-core.wasm is 30.7 MiB, which failed the
# entire deploy and froze the CDN (2026-07-05). The desktop/web-app/ tree is the
# district-configured Firebase-hosted React app (which has no such
# limit) - the CDN only serves REPO-ROOT module files, and nothing references
# alloflow-cdn.pages.dev/desktop/web-app/... or /desktop/... (verified by grep).
# node_modules exists in the build clone after npm ci and would waste most of the
# 20,000-file assets budget.
node_modules/
desktop/web-app/
desktop/

# Development, test, and alternate-deployment trees remain in Git/Codeberg but
# are not runtime assets for alloflow-cdn. Keeping them out of the Workers/Pages
# upload leaves ample room under Cloudflare's per-version static-file limit.
dev-tools/
prismflow-deploy/
tests/

# QA evidence: screenshots, axe reports, and run logs from tool review passes.
# 16,608 files — the entire Cloudflare asset-budget overage (31,388 of 20,000).
# Nothing references reports/ at runtime (verified by grep over root JS/HTML and
# the CDN URL space), so it is excluded on the same basis as tests/ and
# dev-tools/ above: kept in Git/Codeberg, not served by alloflow-cdn.
reports/

# Mulberry symbol sources (1,137 SVGs, CC BY-SA 4.0) are build inputs for word_sounds_symbols/*.json;
# no page loads them. Kept in Git, not uploaded, to save the static-file budget.
data/vendor/mulberry/symbols/

# OpenMoji sources (122 SVGs, CC BY-SA 4.0), the second picture set, are build inputs for
# word_sounds_symbols/*.json in the same way; no page loads them. Kept in Git, not uploaded.
data/vendor/openmoji/symbols/

# Vocabulary bank sources (filtered Wiktionary / WordNet extracts, ~19 MB) are build inputs for
# packets_vocab/*.json (dev-tools/build_packets_vocab_bank.cjs); no page loads them. Kept in Git, not uploaded.
data/vendor/vocab/

# QA/benchmark runs, Remotion video workspace, pending translation staging, and legacy migration
# artifacts (~1,006 files total). Verified 0 runtime references across root HTML/JS and CDN loaders
# (2026-11-14; keeps Cloudflare Pages static-asset count below the 85% / 17,000-file warning threshold;
# mcp-testing/corpus/ and runs/2026-09-22-real-corpus/ remain uploaded for whitepaper.html links).
test-output-spaceexplorer-visual/
my-video/
translations/pending/
migration_sources/
FLEET_2026-08-16/
mcp-testing/runs/
runs/2026-09-22-keyless-pilot/
quality/eppp_provenance/
--quiet/

# Internal doc archives, build inputs, visual audit snapshots, and video spike/source trees
# (~678 files total; preserves docs/teacher-guide/, services/alloflow-remote-mcp/, a11y-audit/,
# test_prep/, export_labels/, mcp-testing/corpus/, and runs/2026-09-22-real-corpus/). Verified 0
# runtime references across root HTML/JS and CDN loaders (2026-11-14; keeps Cloudflare Pages static-asset
# count below the 85% / 17,000-file advisory threshold alongside the 31,973-word word_audio_shards/ set).
Phoneme library/
Instructions List/
.codex-visual-pass/
video_studio/spike/
trailer/src/
research/notebooklm_psychoeducational_fidelity/
